  m_text: '- move with WASD and interact with E/mouse in the central pc

    - try
    to find all the errors (numbers) in the central PC

    - clean that desktop
    daily, moving every icon to the trash, the fired ones documents must be eliminated

    -
    if you do not make it during the day, you will stay the night, throwing paper
    in the trash, tho beware of the boss, he becomes agitated and punches his table
    and the whole office shakes


    good luck

    (ignore the bugs pls, this was
    a ambitious idea :/ )'
